{
  "name": "Customer Support Ticket Bot (Reference Solution)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Support Ticket Bot — Reference Solution\n\n**Flow:** Telegram Trigger → Extract fields → Empty-message check → AI Agent classification (Ollama gemma4 + parser) → Intent Switch (billing / technical / currency-API / general fallback) → each branch logs to Google Sheets and replies via Telegram.\n\n**Classification is LLM-based (LangChain AI Agent), not keyword regex:**\n- 'Ollama Chat Model - Kateqoriya' connects a local Ollama model (gemma4:latest) as the language model.\n- 'Kateqoriya Təyin Edən AI Agent' is given a system prompt that classifies the message into billing/technical/currency/general and is instructed to output only the category word.\n- 'Classify - Parse Category' extracts a clean `category` field from the agent's output, defaulting to 'general' on bad/empty output.\n- 'Classify Intent' Switch is unchanged: it routes on an exact match of `category`, with 'general' as the fallback output.\n\n**Before running:**\n1. Add your Telegram Bot credential (from @BotFather) to the Trigger + all Telegram Send nodes.\n2. Add your Google Sheets credential + spreadsheet/sheet ID to all 4 'Log to Sheet' nodes.\n3. Confirm the 'Ollama Chat Model - Kateqoriya' credential points at your running Ollama instance and that 'gemma4:latest' is pulled/available.\n4. Replace `YOUR_ADMIN_CHAT_ID` in the admin-notify node.\n5. Activate the workflow so the Telegram webhook registers.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "1889456b-072f-480a-9450-6623a0a0c19c",
